{"module":"/assets/explain/knowledge/quadratic-interval-extremum.js","part":"figure","scope":"quadratic-interval-extremum","title":"拖动对称轴：区间上的最大值、最小值落在顶点还是端点","note":"固定区间 $[1,3]$（可切换为开区间 $(1,3)$，中点 $2$）；可切换开口方向，左右拖动对称轴，看最值在顶点、近端点还是远端点，以及开区间端点是否取得到。","after":"bounds","stylesheet":"/assets/explain/knowledge/quadratic-interval-extremum.css","version":"46427b0c7b25","html":"<div class=\"qi-explorer\">\n      <div class=\"qi-switches\">\n        <div class=\"qi-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"开口方向\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-qi-up=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"true\">开口向上</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-qi-up=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"false\">开口向下</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"qi-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"区间\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-qi-open=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\">闭区间 [1, 3]</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-qi-open=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">开区间 (1, 3)</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <svg class=\"qi-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 244\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"qi-graph-title\">\n    <title id=\"qi-graph-title\">一条抛物线和区间 1 到 3，对称轴可以左右拖动</title>\n    <defs><clipPath id=\"qi-clip\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"14\" width=\"310\" height=\"192\"/></clipPath></defs>\n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"14\" width=\"310\" height=\"192\" rx=\"6\" class=\"qi-plot\"/>\n    <rect x=\"133.33333333333331\" y=\"14\" width=\"103.33333333333334\" height=\"192\" class=\"qi-band\"/>\n    <path d=\"M30 154.8H340\" class=\"qi-axis\"/>\n    <text x=\"133.33333333333331\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"qi-tick\">1</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"qi-tick\">2 中点</text><text x=\"236.66666666666666\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"qi-tick\">3</text>\n    <text x=\"185\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"qi-band-label\">x 的取值范围</text>\n    <g data-qi-layer></g>\n  </svg>\n      <input class=\"qi-slider\" type=\"range\" data-qi-slider min=\"-0.25\" max=\"4.25\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"0.5\" aria-label=\"对称轴的位置\">\n      <div class=\"qi-status\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        <p class=\"qi-row low\"><span class=\"qi-tag low\" data-qi-title=\"low\"></span><b data-qi-at=\"low\"></b><small data-qi-why=\"low\"></small></p>\n        <p class=\"qi-row high\"><span class=\"qi-tag high\" data-qi-title=\"high\"></span><b data-qi-at=\"high\"></b><small data-qi-why=\"high\"></small></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>"}
